<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant
is an emerging growth company as defined in&#160;Rule 405&#160;of the&#160;Securities Act of 1933&#160;(&#167;230.405 of this chapter)
or&#160;Rule 12b-2&#160;of the&#160;Securities Exchange Act of 1934&#160;(&#167;240.12b-2 of this chapter).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company&#160;<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_903_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260722__20260722_zlq9kApBtOE4"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-22" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000032" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9746;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check
mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting
standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the&#160;Exchange Act.&#160;<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20260722__20260722_zvfqVbpApZCd"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-22" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000033" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

